# @mixin和@include

在整个样式表中重复使用的样式

用`@mixin`定义样式集合, 用`@include`调用样式集合

`@mixin`内部也可以`@include`

## 语法

```scss
@mixin identifier [(<arguments...>)]{
    // ...
}
```



```scss
@mixin style-set-inner {
  margin: 0;
}

@mixin style-set-outer {
  @include style-set-inner;
  padding: 0;
  li {
    display: inline-block;
    margin: 2px;
  }
}

nav ul {
  @include style-set-outer;
}
```

```css
nav ul {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  list-style: none;
}
nav ul li {
  display: inline-block;
  margin: 2px;
}
```



带参数的用法

```scss
@mixin rtl($property, $ltr-value, $rtl-value) {
  #{$property}: $ltr-value;

  [dir=rtl] & {
    #{$property}: $rtl-value;
  }
}

.sidebar {
  @include rtl(float, left, right);
}
```

```css
.sidebar {
  float: left;
}
[dir=rtl] .sidebar {
  float: right;
}
```

## 参数

### keyword参数

在@mixin声明处指定默认值, 则可用形参名进行参数传递, 则可以

```scss
@mixin props($arg1, $arg2: 0,$arg3: 0) {
  prop1: $arg1;
  prop2: $arg2;
  prop3: $arg3;
}

.avatar {
  @include props(100px, $arg3: 4px);
}
```

```css
.avatar {
  prop1: 100px;
  prop2: 0;
  prop3: 4px;
}
```



### 变长参数

```scss
@mixin order($height, $selectors...) {
  @for $i from 0 to length($selectors) {
    #{nth($selectors, $i + 1)} {
      height: $height;
    }
  }
}

@include order(150px, "input.name", "input.address", "input.zip");
```

```css
input.name {
  position: absolute;
  height: 150px;
  margin-top: 0px;
}

input.address {
  position: absolute;
  height: 150px;
  margin-top: 150px;
}

input.zip {
  position: absolute;
  height: 150px;
  margin-top: 300px;
}
```

## @content块

在include的时候, 接收一个`@content`块, 然后在@mixin的时候也可以选择content块应该在的位置

```css
@mixin hover-mixin {
  &:hover {
    @content;
  }
}

.button {
  border: 1px solid black;
  @include hover-mixin {
    border-width: 2px;
  }
}
```

```css
.button {
  border: 1px solid black;
}
.button:hover {
  border-width: 2px;
}
```



作为@content的实参部分, 是可以使用传入的形参的, @content就好像callback一样, 

使用using来接收参数

```scss
@mixin do-proxy($types...) {
  @each $type in $types {
    data-#{$type} {
      @content($type);
    }
  }
}

@include do-proxy(aaa, bbb) using ($type) {
  prop: $type;
}
```

```css
data-aaa{
    props: aaa
}
data-bbb{
    props: bbb
}
```

